{
  "format": "xp/1",
  "id": "playground",
  "name": "The Playground",
  "blurb": "Nothing to win and everything to knock over. Run into anything and it moves; E kicks it properly, F is a dash. Scatter the ball pit, bowl the skittles down, bat the floaters along - they hang where you leave them - launch something off a spring pad, and see how far you get with the boulder in the middle. Put anything through a hoop for a point.",
